				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.50
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς γλεῦκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					8.23.1
